    "sub_name": "獨立研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INDEPENDENT STUDY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要目的在使同學了解本學院四大研究領域：BIM、Sense Lab、AVR、以及ROSO之後，選定其中一個領域，做更深入的探討與研究，進一步發展為碩士論文之研究架構以及轉化為專題實務訓練成果。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to let students be able to choose their research concentrations after practicing four major research topics: BIM, Sense Lab, AVR, and ROSO. These research concerntations should be based on practices of these four research topics.",
